			"notes": "First stable release of Dynmap for [Better Than Adventure](https://www.betterthanadventure.net/).\n\n## Features\n\n🗺️ **Full BTA Block Support** — Automatic texture extraction and block registration\n\n🌍 **Multi-Dimension Rendering**\n- Overworld with seasonal foliage colors\n- Nether with BTA's unique upper-half terrain (y=128-256)\n- [Better With Aether](https://github.com/bta-team-port/better-with-aether) addon support\n\n🍂 **Season-Aware Rendering** — Spring, Summer, Fall, Winter colormaps\n\n🌲 **Custom Tree Foliage** — Oak, Birch, Pine, Eucalyptus, Shrub and more\n\n🌐 **Real-Time Web Interface** — Season display, day counter, player tracking\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Better Than Adventure **7.3_04**\n- [Babric](https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/bta-fabric-instance-repo) mod loader\n- Java 8+\n\n## Credits\n\n- [Dynmap](https://github.com/webbukkit/dynmap) by mikeprimm\n- [Better Than Adventure](https://www.betterthanadventure.net/)"
		}
